# Explicit Cloud Build upload filter. Its presence stops gcloud from falling back
# to .gitignore (which would exclude models/*.joblib — the baked-in fallback the
# image needs). Keep app/ and models/*.joblib IN the build context.
*.md
*.ps1
smoke_test.py
http_test.py
retrain/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
models/manifest.json
